+
+`mirage` settings:
+
+| Field | Type | Default | Meaning |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| `offset` | number | `5` | Size of the first record's handshake bytes (1 to 16383). Safe sizes depend on the network: 1, 2, 4 and 5 passed in Iran in 2026, 3 and 6 or more were dropped. |
